// machineSession - the module-side MachineController singleton and its wiring
// into useMachineControl. Mirrors how the CNCViewport engine lives outside
// React: components call these functions from event handlers and subscribe to
// the store for state. Framework-free (no React imports).
//
// WO-422 / ADR-0041: everything from here up talks to the MachineController
// INTERFACE. The backend behind it is chosen once, at connect, by
// connectMachine(kind) - GRBL over a byte pipe today, the AXBB-E bridge for
// 'bridge'. The one exception is deliberate and named: `grblBackend` below,
// which exists for the two capabilities the contract does not carry.
//
// Every entry point that can MOVE the machine stays an explicit user action;
// nothing in this module fires on import or on a timer except the
// controller's own read-only status polling.

